        <mxCell id="c35" value="&lt;b&gt;Neither:&lt;/b&gt; the year&#x27;s income never reaches equity" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="266" width="120" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c37" value="&lt;i&gt;The six closing entries, two for each year, all dated December 31. At 2026-12, the latest month-end, Balance keeps the closes of 2024 and 2025, which are dated before the as-of date and move each year&#x27;s income to retained earnings, and leaves out the two of 2026, dated on it (outlined). Equity then reads -20,928,484.44 under Balance, -25,432,095.68 with every close kept and -10,683,821.46 on GL Amount; revenue and expense read -4,503,611.24 (the net income of 2026), 0.00 and -14,748,274.22 (all years).&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="350" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
